{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ebe51e5abca35866fcd1fdb519952f45b7e953bee12623e1034e73b3c8aec57", "ja": "（今日は環と、社会人を応援するイベントに来ている。\n環は、ステージで歌を歌う予定だ）", "zh": "（今天和环一起来参加为职场人士加油的活动。环预定要在舞台上唱歌）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "98ba5ec0843cde242493654181740d8834521ada179d8098af2dbf211be03a7b", "ja": "おやぶん、おやぶーん！", "zh": "老大，老大——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "36f24a588de797631425071cd0dee0d08eb6cd192a2948007d34ee89a7a1747d", "ja": "環、お疲れさま。\nそんなに慌ててどうしたんだ？", "zh": "环，辛苦了。\n怎么这么慌慌张张的，是出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "0c6298bdb2c2c9caf6cd50f87767d110e95fd7dee7fab1e1b00b7809be11fec4", "ja": "あのね、おやぶんに聞きたいことがあって……\n『休日出勤』って、なに？", "zh": "那个啊，环有事想问老大……\n“休假加班”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bc6a87e897228e4412515c296a9f6351f9f27ee0048065da9cbdc5df4521d671", "ja": "休日出勤？　ああ、休みの日に\n会社に行って、仕事をする事だよ。", "zh": "假日加班？啊，就是在休息日去公司工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "20ac2e42a218025edd0e18f7aaaa45cbdf5e1c880840902ae65338af8d65034d", "ja": "え、お休みなのに、お仕事するの……？\nなんで？", "zh": "诶，明明是休息日，却还要工作……？\n为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a1d2fba7e8c4a9761ce45750ec5222e2ea89c075a6e21104ccbbe4b79b096005", "ja": "なんでって言われても、仕事だからな。\nそれより、どうして急にそんなことを？", "zh": "就算你这么问，这是工作啊。\n话说回来，你怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "82710a8bd81f5a2393c279afe55d8abbc5555fa678df4d1c00d5eebcb95bbed0", "ja": "ファンの人からもらったお手紙に、書いてあったよ。\n休日出勤だから、今日のライブ観に来られないって。", "zh": "粉丝寄来的信上写着哦。\n因为要在休息日加班，所以今天没法来看演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "3fabf563e9356450d1d9c6cf2bcbd0d5c70cad9f4c2c94b07f065139e6c8ad04", "ja": "「すごく残念です」って書いてあって……\nおやぶん、この人のこと、助けてあげて！", "zh": "上面写着“非常遗憾”……\n老大，去帮帮这个人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fbfbae42043e03a79a93f4268ac75854b151837751a9e7bb06eab2e055f37206", "ja": "そ、そうだな。助けてあげたいけど、\n知らない仕事じゃ、手伝えないしな……。", "zh": "是、是啊。虽然想帮忙，可要是不了解的工作，也没法帮忙啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "ca88b5e33f33d6e501d85b4cb406f3e565bff3b1e9a60470c098d55b2a916aac", "ja": "お休みの日もお仕事するなんて、かわいそう……\nお仕事、キライになっちゃわない？", "zh": "休息日也要工作，真可怜……\n不会变得讨厌工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "460ad0d9eb2412ef5100329475be4425834b8c3a589fabd50b9920297199a741", "ja": "大人はお仕事たくさんするのに、キライに\nなっちゃうなんて。そんなの悲しいぞ……。", "zh": "大人明明要做那么多工作，却会变得\n讨厌工作。那样太让人伤心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "15a11cd75dcb674adc13d77368baee321ef1efefc833bee969d68a92b0ae5f2a", "ja": "おやぶんにできないお仕事なら、たまきも\n手伝えないよね？　どうしたらいいんだろ……うぅ。", "zh": "如果是老大都做不到的工作，环也帮不上忙吧？该怎么办才好呢……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1013_p", "source_sha256": "123bf9fe84175186179de78ef322901015d9cf58d91eace3f3c4953bb111c5b1", "ja": "そうだな。でも、環だからこそ助けてあげられる\n方法が、ひとつだけあると思うんだけど。", "zh": "是啊。不过，我觉得正因为是小环，才有一个能帮上忙的办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "237914e1bddfce0d8098684f2b15d4e91a06fcb37b4d3ca469ff257e4406c990", "ja": "えっ、ほんと？\nおやぶん、たまきどうすればいいの！？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？\n大哥，环要怎么做才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b6bef9fc13c8eb8dc3076cb693f9917c216c82afb558e0435196fecd23870091", "ja": "今日のライブは、後日テレビで放送されるんだ。\nだから、環が最高に楽しいステージにすれば……。", "zh": "今天的演出之后会在电视上播出。所以，只要环把它变成最棒、最开心的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "962c7b84729485a1707550ccb5631a8367fa18d59756e6624e04cbd30de922cc", "ja": "たまきがみんなのこと、元気にできる！？\nわぁ……さすが、おやぶんだね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "小环能让大家打起精神来！？  \n哇……不愧是老大！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ce6947e30ad41bf5139c37510655c2a77579c2e1326717305048e49bc7dbe3df", "ja": "たまき、がんばる！　休日出勤の人も、\nたまきのステージで、元気になるといいな～。", "zh": "环会加油的！希望那些休息日还来上班的人，也能因为环的舞台而打起精神来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "259fcac55b2a1f1134a051db81d7d2ea8697c68f41b339ecdac14a1757811125", "ja": "（そして、環はステージの上で\nいつも以上に元気いっぱいな姿を見せた）", "zh": "（然后，环在舞台上展现出了比平时更加活力十足的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "8cddec8362be4c6b6f58c1b7429d6f8058dd03295eb9107551cb68a7e05c4d3f", "ja": "みんな、今日は来てくれてありがとー！\n今日お仕事のみんな、テレビ見てるー？", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们今天来看我——！\n今天还在工作的大家，有在看电视吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "615fb4b273351df655d85b826b3ede24d115fa52a7a97526d4bceaf8ae9c06a8", "ja": "お仕事がんばってるみんな、お疲れさまだぞ～！\n今日はたまきのライブで、元気になってね！", "zh": "努力工作的大家，辛苦啦～！\n今天就看环的演唱会，打起精神来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2206d9268943ccca08f789fb4b7dcb6f0cb67b2bcfa994619242dcfda08b1d9c", "ja": "（後日、例のファンの人から元気になったと手紙が届き\n環は飛び上がって喜んでいた。……やったな、環！）", "zh": "（后来，那位粉丝寄来了信，说自己已经振作起来了，环高兴得都跳了起来。……干得漂亮，环！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
